modern/experiments/pic2d_cft_steady_state_v3/results*/
# PIC-2D plume development run v1 (model v2.0): results stay untracked until the run ends;
# attempt 3 (no ignition) is kept as a development record: summary (with the frames manifest),
# run state, status/series/maps, final checkpoint metadata; the frames, the videos, the
# particle checkpoint and the raw logs are not tracked.
modern/experiments/pic2d_cft_plume_v1/results*/
!modern/experiments/pic2d_cft_plume_v1/results-attempt3-no-ignition/
